        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Linhai, Gongqingcheng\n- Administrative divisions: county-level cities, Taizhou, Zhejiang, Jiangxi, China\n- Concepts: Tai-chow dialect\n\nFacts:\n- Linhai is a county-level city in Taizhou, Zhejiang Province, in eastern China.\n- Linhai is situated on the banks of the Lin River.\n- Linhai is called Ling-he in the Tai-chow dialect.\n- Gongqingcheng is a county-level city in northern Jiangxi province, People's Republic of China.\n- Gongqingcheng was established on 10 September 2010.",
